--
libc++'s <mutex> static_assert(is_nothrow_default_constructible<mutex>::value)
(mutex.h:47), dropped (fails on bin53) while __is_nothrow_constructible was
false for the
defaulted default constructor (test.desc).  --verbosity 10 lists the dropped
declaration.  clang++ 18 with libc++ accepts the program.
